    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Anne: I also want to learn Chinese. Where can you buy Chinese books?"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "高天：书店有汉语书。你想买汉语书吗？",
