      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Gao Tian: There are Chinese books at the bookstore. Do you want to buy Chinese books?"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "Anne：我想买汉语书。书店远吗？",
