      "What Book Is This?",
      "",
      "Gao Tian: Good afternoon! Anne!",
      "",
      "Anne: Good Afternoon! You’re reading a book. What book is this?",
      "",
      "Gao Tian: This is a Chinese book. I’m learning Chinese.",
      "",
      "Anne: I also want to learn Chinese. Where can you buy Chinese books?",
      "",
      "Gao Tian: There are Chinese books at the bookstore. Do you want to buy Chinese books?",
      "",
      "Anne: I want to buy Chinese books. Is the bookstore far?",
      "",
      "Gao Tian: No, it’s not far. How about I go with you?",
      "",
